2026 Hatto Social contributors), recorded in REUSE.toml:

- fsrs-synthetic-37k.apkg. Synthetic deck from the host harness
  (tools/arm64-smoke/make_expected_fsrs.py). No media members. Its expected
  FSRS numbers were captured with the phone's time zone set to Asia/Seoul
  and were not regenerated here.
- stock-notes.apkg. Synthetic deck from the host harness
